        "Content": "﻿LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\n4/5 BED 3 BATH SEMI DETACHED HOME IN AN IDYLlIC SETTING\r\nBEAUTIFUL BACK GARDEN WHICH TAKES FULL ADVANTAGE OF SOUTHERLY SUN\r\nEXTRA WIDE SIDE ENTRANCE\r\nIDYLLIC CUL DE SAC POSITION OVERLOOKING GREEN\r\nWALKING DISTANCE FROM STAMULLEN VILLAGE\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED\r\n\r\nA most captivating home in an idyllic setting….\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Stamullen Property Specialists are truly delighted to present No. 18 Gracemeadows Ave to the Stamullen property market. No. 18 is sure to attract strong interest from families, parties trading up and first time buyers alike.\r\n\r\nThe extra spacious floor plan consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining / family room, sitting room / study / bedroom 5, utility & guest toilet.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are 4 bedrooms (3 large double) to include primary en suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe features of this lovely home include: Quality flooring throughout, feature stove in sitting room, doors from kitchen / dining / family room leading to gardeb & modern fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nThe property further boasts double glazed upvc windows.\r\n\r\nTo the front there is a driveway and garden. To the rear is a large mature garden together with beautiful covered entertaining / dining space.\r\n\r\nThe property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools and the area is further serviced by an excellent bus service (there is also a private commuter service making the city most accessible.\r\n\r\nThe train station at Gormanstown is only a 6 minute drive away.\r\n\r\nNo. 18 is a most strategically positioned home.\r\n\r\nThe M1 Motorway, Drogheda, Balbriggan, Skerries, Swords and Dublin International Airport are all close by.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
